                  )
                  | Sparkjam 2026
                  |   - A design jam
              .project-detail-item
                h3 Timeframe
                p May 2026 (5 days)
              .project-detail-item
                h3 Project focus
                ul.smaller-list-indent
                  li Accessible design
                  li UX research
                  li High-fidelity prototyping
              .project-detail-item
                h3 Tools used
                ul.smaller-list-indent
                  li Figjam/Figma
                  li Claude Code
              .project-detail-item
                h3 The team
                ul.smaller-list-indent
                  li
                    a.button-tiny(
                      target="_blank" 
                      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/amandajeng19/"
                      ) Amanda Eng
                  li
                    a.button-tiny(
                      target="_blank" 
                      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elizabeth-liz-liao/"
                      ) Elizabeth Liao
                  li
                    a.button-tiny(
                      target="_blank" 
                      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irina-ng-035a4b251/"
                      ) Irina Ng
              .project-detail-item
                h3 What I did
                p
                  | Conducted autoethnography, designed and created the prototype, and developed a persona (Linda) to center our pitch around storytelling.
        #toc.toc
          h2 In this piece
          ul
            li
              a(
                data-target="mission" 
                href="#mission"
                ) The mission & first day
            li
              a(
                data-target="research" 
                href="#research"
                )
                | Research
            li
              a(
                data-target="solution" 
                href="#solution"
                )
